msgstr "Instalação do zsh"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/shells/zsh.xml:95
#, xml-text
msgid "Adapt the documentation build system for texinfo-7.0 or later:"
msgstr ""
"Adapte o sistema de construção de documentação para texinfo-7.0 ou "
"posterior:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/shells/zsh.xml:98
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>sed -e 's/set_from_init_file/texinfo_&amp;/' \\\n"
"    -i Doc/Makefile.in</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>sed -e 's/set_from_init_file/texinfo_&amp;/' \\\n"
"    -i Doc/Makefile.in</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/shells/zsh.xml:104
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Some programs shipped in the building system for detecting system features "
"use pre-C99 syntax rejected by GCC-14.1 or later.  Fix them up or Zsh would "
"be wrongly configured and fail to build:"
msgstr ""
"Alguns programas fornecidos no sistema de construção para detectar recursos "
"do sistema usam sintaxe pré-C99 rejeitada pelo GCC-14.1 ou posterior. "
"Corrija-os ou o Zsh seria configurado incorretamente e falharia para "
"construir:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/shells/zsh.xml:109
#, no-wrap, xml-text
#| msgid ""
#| "<userinput>sed -i -e 's/^main/int &amp;/' -e 's/exit(/return(/' aczsh.m4 configure.ac &amp;&amp;\n"
#| "sed -i 's/test = /&amp;(char**)/'                    configure.ac          &amp;&amp;\n"
#| "autoconf</userinput>"
msgid ""
"<userinput>sed -e 's/^main/int &amp;/'      \\\n"
"    -e 's/exit(/return(/'    \\\n"
"    -i aczsh.m4 configure.ac &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"sed -e 's/test = /&amp;(char**)/' \\\n"
"    -i configure.ac           &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"autoconf</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>sed -e 's/^main/int &amp;/'      \\\n"
"    -e 's/exit(/return(/'    \\\n"
"    -i aczsh.m4 configure.ac &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"sed -e 's/test = /&amp;(char**)/' \\\n"
"    -i configure.ac           &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"autoconf</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/shells/zsh.xml:119
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The documentation files contain references to zsh configuration files in "
"<filename class='directory'>/etc</filename>, but we'll use <filename "
"class='directory'>/etc/zsh</filename> to hold these configuration files "
"instead.  The building system will fix up those references if the "
"<application>yodl</application> package is available, but it's out of the "
"scope of BLFS.  So we need to fix up the references manually:"
msgstr ""
"Os arquivos de documentação contém referências aos arquivos de configuração "
"do zsh em <filename class='directory'>/etc</filename>, mas nós usaremos "
"<filename class='directory'>/etc/zsh</filename> para armazenar esses "
"arquivos de configuração em vez disso. O sistema de construção corrigirá "
"essas referências se o pacote <application>yodl</application> estiver "
"disponível, mas está fora do escopo do BLFS. Portanto, nós precisamos "
"corrigir as referências manualmente:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/shells/zsh.xml:128
#, no-wrap, xml-text
#| msgid "<userinput>sed 's|/etc/z|/etc/zsh/z|g' -i Doc/*.*</userinput>"
msgid ""
"<userinput>sed -e 's|/etc/z|/etc/zsh/z|g' \\\n"
"    -i Doc/*.*</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>sed -e 's|/etc/z|/etc/zsh/z|g' \\\n"
"    -i Doc/*.*</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/shells/zsh.xml:140
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Install <application>zsh</application> by running the following commands:"
msgstr ""
"Instale <application>zsh</application> executando os seguintes comandos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/shells/zsh.xml:144
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>./configure --prefix=/usr            \\\n"
"            --sysconfdir=/etc/zsh    \\\n"
"            --enable-etcdir=/etc/zsh \\\n"
"            --enable-cap             \\\n"
"            --enable-gdbm                      &amp;&amp;\n"
"make                                           &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"makeinfo  Doc/zsh.texi --html      -o Doc/html &amp;&amp;\n"
"makeinfo  Doc/zsh.texi --plaintext -o zsh.txt  &amp;&amp;\n"
"makeinfo  Doc/zsh.texi --html --no-split --no-headers -o zsh.html</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>./configure --prefix=/usr            \\\n"
"            --sysconfdir=/etc/zsh    \\\n"
"            --enable-etcdir=/etc/zsh \\\n"
"            --enable-cap             \\\n"
"            --enable-gdbm                      &amp;&amp;\n"
"make                                           &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"makeinfo  Doc/zsh.texi --html      -o Doc/html &amp;&amp;\n"
"makeinfo  Doc/zsh.texi --plaintext -o zsh.txt  &amp;&amp;\n"
"makeinfo  Doc/zsh.texi --html --no-split --no-headers -o zsh.html</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/shells/zsh.xml:156
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If you have <xref linkend=\"texlive\"/> installed, you can build PDF format "
"of the documentation by issuing the following command:"
msgstr ""
"Se você tiver <xref linkend=\"texlive\"/> instalado, [então] poderá "
"construir o formato PDF da documentação emitindo o seguinte comando:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/shells/zsh.xml:161
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>texi2pdf  Doc/zsh.texi -o Doc/zsh.pdf</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>texi2pdf Doc/zsh.texi -o Doc/zsh.pdf</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/shells/zsh.xml:164
#, xml-text
msgid "To test the results, issue: <command>make check</command>."
msgstr "Para testar os resultados, emita: <command>make check</command>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/shells/zsh.xml:168
#, xml-text
msgid "Now, as the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Agora, como o(a) usuário(a) <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/shells/zsh.xml:171
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>make install                                                    &amp;&amp;\n"
"make infodir=/usr/share/info install.info                       &amp;&amp;\n"
"make htmldir=/usr/share/doc/zsh-&zsh-version;/html install.html           &amp;&amp;\n"
"install -v -m644 zsh.{html,txt} Etc/FAQ /usr/share/doc/zsh-&zsh-version;</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>make install                                                    &amp;&amp;\n"
"make infodir=/usr/share/info install.info                       &amp;&amp;\n"
"make htmldir=/usr/share/doc/zsh-&zsh-version;/html install.html           &amp;&amp;\n"
"install -v -m644 zsh.{html,txt} Etc/FAQ /usr/share/doc/zsh-&zsh-version;</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/shells/zsh.xml:177
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If you built the PDF format of the documentation, install it by issuing the "
"following command as the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> "
"user:"
msgstr ""
"Se você construiu o formato PDF da documentação, [então] instale-o emitindo "
"o seguinte comando como o(a) usuário(a) <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/shells/zsh.xml:183
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>install -v -m644 Doc/zsh.pdf /usr/share/doc/zsh-&zsh-"
"version;</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>install -v -m644 Doc/zsh.pdf /usr/share/doc/zsh-&zsh-"
"version;</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/shells/zsh.xml:188
#, xml-text
msgid "Command Explanations"
msgstr "Explicações do Comando"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/shells/zsh.xml:191
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>--sysconfdir=/etc/zsh</parameter> and <parameter>--enable-"
"etcdir=/etc/zsh</parameter>: These parameters are used so that all the "
"<application>zsh</application> configuration files are consolidated into the"
" <filename class='directory'>/etc/zsh</filename> directory. Omit these "
"parameters if you wish to retain historical compatibility by having all the "
"files located in the <filename class='directory'>/etc</filename> directory."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>--sysconfdir=/etc/zsh</parameter> e <parameter>--enable-"
"etcdir=/etc/zsh</parameter>: Esses parâmetros são usados para que todos os "
"arquivos de configuração do <application>zsh</application> sejam "
"consolidados no diretório <filename class='directory'>/etc/zsh</filename>. "
"Omita esses parâmetros se você desejar manter a compatibilidade histórica "
"tendo todos os arquivos localizados no diretório <filename "
"class='directory'>/etc</filename>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/shells/zsh.xml:201
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>--enable-cap</parameter>: This option enables POSIX capabilities."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>--enable-cap</parameter>: Essa opção habilita os recursos POSIX."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/shells/zsh.xml:206
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>--enable-gdbm</parameter>: This option enables the use of the "
"<application>GDBM</application> library."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>--enable-gdbm</parameter>: Essa opção habilita o uso da "
"biblioteca <application>GDBM</application>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/shells/zsh.xml:219
#, xml-text
msgid "Configuring zsh"
msgstr "Configurando o zsh"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><title>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/shells/zsh.xml:222
#, xml-text
msgid "Config Files"
msgstr "Arquivos de Configuração"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/shells/zsh.xml:225
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"There are a whole host of configuration files for "
"<application>zsh</application> including "
"<filename>/etc/zsh/zshenv</filename>, "
"<filename>/etc/zsh/zprofile</filename>, <filename>/etc/zsh/zshrc</filename>,"
" <filename>/etc/zsh/zlogin</filename> and "
"<filename>/etc/zsh/zlogout</filename>.  You can find more information on "
"these in the <ulink role='man' url='&man;zsh.1'>zsh(1)</ulink> and related "
"manual pages."
msgstr ""
"Existe toda uma série de arquivos de configuração para o "
"<application>zsh</application>, incluindo "
"<filename>/etc/zsh/zshenv</filename>, "
"<filename>/etc/zsh/zprofile</filename>, <filename>/etc/zsh/zshrc</filename>,"
" <filename>/etc/zsh/zlogin</filename> e "
"<filename>/etc/zsh/zlogout</filename>. Você consegue encontrar mais "
"informação a respeito deles na <ulink role='man' "
"url='&man;zsh.1'>zsh(1)</ulink> e nas páginas de manual relacionadas."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/shells/zsh.xml:238
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The first time zsh is executed, you will be prompted by messages asking "
"several questions. The answers will be used to create a "
"<filename>~/.zshrc</filename> file. If you wish to run these questions "
"again, run <command>zsh /usr/share/zsh/&zsh-version;/functions/zsh-newuser-"
"install -f</command>."
msgstr ""
"Na primeira vez que o zsh for executado, você será avisado(a) por mensagens "
"com várias perguntas. As respostas serão usadas para criar um arquivo "
"<filename>~/.zshrc</filename>. Se desejar executar essas perguntas "
"novamente, [então] execute <command>zsh /usr/share/zsh/&zsh-"
"version;/functions/zsh-newuser-install -f</command>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/shells/zsh.xml:246
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"There are several built-in advanced prompts. In the <command>zsh</command> "
"shell, start advanced prompt support with <command>autoload -U "
"promptinit</command>, then <command>promptinit</command>. Available prompt "
"names are listed with <command>prompt -l</command>. Select a particular one "
"with <command>prompt <literal>&lt;prompt-name&gt;</literal></command>.  "
"Display all available prompts with <command>prompt -p</command>. Except for "
"the list and display commands above, you can insert the other ones in "
"<filename>~/.zshrc</filename> to be automatically executed at shell start, "
"with the prompt you chose."
msgstr ""
"Existem vários prompts avançados integrados. No shell "
"<command>zsh</command>, inicie o suporte avançado de prompt com "
"<command>autoload -U promptinit</command> e, em seguida, "
"<command>promptinit</command>. Os nomes disponíveis de prompt são listados "
"com <command>prompt -l</command>. Selecione um em particular com "
"<command>prompt <literal>&lt;nome-de-prompt&gt;</literal></command>. Exiba "
"todos os prompts disponíveis com <command>prompt -p</command>. Exceto os "
"comandos \"list\" e \"display\" acima, você consegue inserir os outros em "
"<filename>~/.zshrc</filename> para serem executados automaticamente na "
"iniciação do shell, com o prompt que escolher."

